.3069, 92.0628, 92.6061, 92.4415, 92.0675, 90.8321, 92.278, 91.9855, 93.2995, 94.0056, 94.759, 93.1073, 92.2672, 92.47, 95.3238, 95.9406, 95.5991, 97.0226, 97.6925, 99.262, 99.9145, 99.3071, 98.9087, 100.0371, 101.0267, 103.049, 105.1455, 104.1262, 103.4948, 105.2885, 107.1356, 105.4774, 108.4978, 109.532, 109.7806, 110.3763, 111.4833, 111.078, 112.796, 112.4262, 110.2518, 109.5442, 107.578, 109.3881, 107.996, 107.8623, 109.2814, 108.5221, 109.3622, 108.912, 109.0429, 106.664, 109.6349, 109.5871, 109.5382, 108.8166, 108.1642, 108.4766, 106.6038, 107.7244, 108.6565, 108.8426, 109.3573, 109.5579, 109.9447, 111.4672, 111.4113, 110.2983, 107.0396, 104.459, 105.5941, 104.7704, 106.494, 105.5716, 105.9295, 108.9581, 108.4641, 108.833, 107.5842, 107.5859, 106.3532, 104.8606, 104.7257, 104.0192, 104.2467, 103.295, 103.6146, 103.7522, 104.2853, 105.6031, 107.8182, 109.7268, 108.6741, 109.0424, 109.5846, 108.1321, 104.524, 103.4156, 103.3585, 104.5253, 103.2337, 104.7271, 104.5442, 103.302, 103.9096, 103.7545, 103.8455, 102.5787, 102.657, 102.2188, 102.2056, 103.6679, 105.8907, 105.021, 104.3841, 105.7421, 108.6135, 110.0636, 109.9278, 111.9391, 111.9254, 111.1674, 111.8226, 112.673, 111.3193, 110.2549, 111.1838, 112.0785, 112.1844, 112.2888, 110.5326, 108.8385, 109.02, 109.628, 110.5354, 110.6639, 111.4754, 111.4677, 111.9484, 113.219, 113.4057, 115.2928, 117.884, 118.3253, 117.7083, 118.6217, 118.7996, 117.3289, 118.9996, 117.9811, 121.4367, 121.8001, 123.363, 123.5405, 121.4468, 122.873, 124.9076, 126.2973, 128.9169, 129.28, 133.5719, 133.9529, 134.795, 131.9463, 131.1434, 129.5631, 127.5281, 128.8387, 132.2647, 132.8398, 132.2285, 135.4134, 141.9838, 141.1065, 142.6274, 143.2626, 144.4233, 145.0239, 143.6139, 142.3465, 143.6014, 141.9645, 144.9804, 145.7585, 147.7846, 147.7297, 149.092, 149.7914, 151.8279, 150.5752, 150.6311, 148.3846, 144.3962, 145.1794, 143.6183, 143.5626, 144.5804, 144.2409, 145.4565, 144.7679, 144.7288, 145.2427, 147.3785], "summary_html": "<h1>Nominal Price Illusion x Momentum Factor</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>This paper documents that the stock momentum effect is significantly stronger among assets with high nominal price illusion -- i.e., assets whose prices are low relative to fundamentals. The mechanism is behavioral: investors overestimate the upside potential of low-priced assets, causing loser stocks with low nominal prices to be overvalued and subsequently underperform, amplifying momentum profits.</p>\n<p>For commodities, we adapt the paper's log PRC* measure (originally the fitted value from a cross-sectional regression of stock price on book value, earnings, total assets, and dividends) using the negative log of the commodity futures closing price as a proxy for nominal price illusion. This captures the same behavioral channel: low-priced commodities may attract speculative optimism. The key tradeable factor is the interaction between momentum rank and price-illusion rank: buy commodities with both high momentum and high illusion (low price), short those with low momentum and low illusion (high price).</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.7</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>3.2%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>4.6%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-12.2%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.02</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>3276</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>0.88</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>0.51</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.13 / 0.67</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2013</th><th>2014</th><th>2015</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.87</span></td><td>0.28</td><td>0.17</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.51</span></td><td>1.21</td><td>1.6</td><td>1.38</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.62</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.53</span></td><td>1.78</td><td>0.68</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.71</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.69</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.36</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每 252 个交易日</li>\n<li><strong>信号更新</strong>: 每日计算，每 252 天生效</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>58</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>3278</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>97.9%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>40.3</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p><strong>Momentum (MOM)</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{MOM}_{i,t} = \\frac{P_{i,t-21}}{P_{i,t-273}} - 1</div>\n<p>11-month cumulative return, skipping the most recent month (21 trading days).</p>\n<p><strong>Nominal Price Illusion Proxy</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{NPI}_{i,t} = -\\ln(P_{i,t})</div>\n<p>Negative log price -- higher values indicate greater illusion (lower absolute price).</p>\n<p><strong>Price-Momentum Interaction</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{Signal}_{i,t} = \\text{rank}_{\\text{CS}}(\\text{MOM}_{i,t}) \\times \\text{rank}_{\\text{CS}}(\\text{NPI}_{i,t})</div>\n<p>Cross-sectional rank product of momentum and price illusion.</p>\n<p><strong>Position</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{pos}_{i,t} = \\frac{(\\text{rank}(\\text{Signal}) - 0.5) \\times 2 \\times \\sigma_{\\text{target}}}{\\hat{\\sigma}_{i,t} \\times \\sqrt{252}}</div>\n<p>Vol-target scaled continuous long-short position.</p>\n<h2>改进历程</h2>\n<p><strong>R1</strong> (Sharpe 0.81): Initial implementation with all four factors from the paper -- pure momentum, price illusion (neg log price), MAX (max daily return), and realized skewness -- plus their pairwise and triple interactions with momentum. 10 variants covering 3 momentum windows (63d, 126d, 252d) and all factor combinations. The price-momentum interaction at 252d immediately stood out as the best factor (0.81), validating the paper's core finding. Key diagnostic: TS IC was only 0.005 with 54% positive symbols, suggesting room for filtering or parameter tuning.</p>\n<p><strong>R2</strong> (Sharpe 0.94): Diagnosed that the monthly rebalance (hold=21d) was suboptimal -- the momentum signal updates daily but positions only refresh monthly. Shortened hold period to 10 days, which reduced signal lag and improved Sharpe to 0.94 (+16%). Also tested IC-gating (filtering weak symbols) and hold=42d; IC-gating showed no improvement (same Sharpe as ungated), confirming the signal is broadly effective across symbols. The hold=10d variant was the clear winner -- the key turning point of the iteration.</p>\n<p><strong>R3</strong> (Sharpe 0.90): Fine-tuned hold period grid (5d, 10d, 15d, 21d) and vol-target (0.10, 0.15, 0.20). Also created a weighted combo of price-momentum and triple interaction. Hold=15d scored 0.90, hold=5d was similar but noisier. Vol-target variations did not improve over 0.15. The combo variant (0.83) was decent but didn't beat the pure price-momentum interaction. Pipeline auto-restored to R2's spec_best (0.94).</p>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 0.9679</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 0.69s</li>\n</ul>"}